  "identifier": "dseams",
  "description": "Structural analysis of water and ice in molecular dynamics trajectories, using the 'd-SEAMS' engine (Goswami, Goswami and Singh (2020) <doi:10.1021/acs.jcim.0c00031>). Reads 'LAMMPS' dumps and 'XYZ' files and returns data frames of 'CHILL+' ice labels (Nguyen and Molinero (2015) <doi:10.1021/jp510289t>), primitive ring counts (Franzblau (1991) <doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.44.4925>), hexagonal and double-diamond cages, and Steinhardt bond-orientational order parameters (Steinhardt, Nelson and Ronchetti (1983) <doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.28.784>). The engine is compiled from bundled C++ sources.",
